    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "司会",
    "text": "今回、このように\r\n園田さんを起用された理由というのは──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "日本店の責任者",
    "text": "代表の、たっての希望です",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010018020020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "わ、本当ですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001802/2010018020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "日本店の責任者",
    "text": "ええ。販売イベントのため、\r\n代表が来日することも多いのですが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "1537"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "日本店の責任者",
    "text": "日本でチョコといえば、\r\nいつでもチョコアイドルが話題にあがると話していて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "日本店の責任者",
    "text": "うちのチョコレートを食べている表情が\r\nとびきり可愛らしい──と喜んでいました",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0328"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010018020030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そんなそんな……！\r\n恐縮です……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001802/2010018020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "日本店の責任者",
    "text": "いやいや、真っ当な感想ですよ！\r\n──でも、それだけではないんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "2392"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "日本店の責任者",
    "text": "代表は、『園田さんに惹かれて調べてみたら──\r\n単にチョコが好きな方ではないとわかった』と",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
